---
description: Security rules for the repo
alwaysApply: true
---

never: write, print, log, commit, or echo secrets or anything sensative 
don't use eval on user input
no html_safe / raw on untrusted input
Use parameterized queries, never string-interpolate SQL
never read from or expose any ignored files 
Do not disable CSRF, mass assignment protection, or Devise's session checks
